{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21800","headline":"有鸟二十章 十四 · 元稹","name":"有鸟二十章 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有鸟有鸟羣雀儿，中庭啄粟篱上飞。\n秋鹰欺小嫌不食，凤皇容衆从尔随。\n大鹏忽起遮白日，余风簸荡山岳移。\n翩翾百万徒惊噪，扶摇势远何由知。\n古来妄说衔花报，纵解衔花何所爲。\n可惜官仓无限粟，伯夷饿死黄口肥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}